  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Pretty Girl**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Buenas Tardes**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween1996-10-25** (recommended): audience recording; 24 songs; 114 min [1]\n- **Ween1996-10-25.ecm909**: source not stated; 24 songs; 119 min [2]. Said about its sound: Digital noise glitches appear in \"Pretty Girl\" (0:59-1:24), \"Pumpin' 4 The Man\" (0:06) and \"Blarney Stone\" (2:02) [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween1996-10-25**: taped by Unknown; transferred by jkeats; source: Unknown aud [1]\n- **Ween1996-10-25.ecm909**: taped by RG; source: Sony ECM-909 > Sony TCD-D7 [2]. Also: Recorded with a Sony ECM-909 microphone into a Sony TCD-D7 DAT recorder; chain runs DAT master to DAT copy, then WAV, then FLAC; Transferred using a Tascam DA-20mkII and M-Audio Audiophile 2496 card, edited in Sound Forge, with CD Wave used [2]",
